WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:36.450
I'm Kurata Sana, age 11.
I'm a sixth grader,

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:38.620
who's also in Gekidan Komawari,
and active as an entertainer.

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:43.830
Sagami Rei-kun. He's both
my chauffeur and my manager,

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.580
as well as my boyfriend and pimp!

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:49.000
Mama. She's an Aoki Laureate novelist
who keeps a chipmunk on her head.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:56.220
And this is the fiend who is in my class,
6th Grade 3rd Class, Hayama Akito!

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.880
He's like the devil!

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.180
Thanks to Hayama,
the class is a shambles!

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.930
He makes me so irritated, my mood graph
is all lied up in knots!

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.770
Do something about him!

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:12.520
Stop this! Stop already, you guys!

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:16.610
Cut that out, you guys! I can't put up
with any more of this! I'm about to...

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:21.620
What are you going to do, Sensei?

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.620
I don't mind going public with this.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.180
Cut it out already, would you, Hayama?

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.560
Yeah!

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.560
Cut it out, Hayama-kun!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.900
We can't have class like this!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.900
It's unbelievable! Every day,
you do the same foolish things!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.240
Hayama, you really are the worst!
You're an idiot!

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.570
He's more the devil than an idiot!
The devil!

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.490
Uh oh, now I've started it.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.240
Akito-kun...

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.120
--Hayama, the devil! The devil's boy!
--Hayama, the devil! The devil's boy!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.250
--Go back to the land of devils!
--Go back to the land of devils!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.250
You've got a lot of nerve, girls!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:15.210
What are you talking about!? You're the
guys that suck up to Hayama so much!

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:20.930
Hold it!

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.180
Are you running away?

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:24.600
Hey.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.310
Whoa! What are you doing!?
Come on, let me go!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:31.230
All he has to say is "hey,"
and you guys listen to him?

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:32.940
What are you, dogs?
Come on, say "woof" for me!

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:36.610
Hayama-san is going to wash
his face. Don't bother him!

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.610
Hold it, Hayama!

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.450
You're the boss monkey
of Monkey Mountain!

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.950
Don't try putting on airs!
You're the ooze of 3rd Class! Ooze!

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.280
And before long, someone is
going to make you into oozecakes,

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.950
sprinkle you with soy flour,
and eat you up!

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.750
You mean kudzu cakes, like these!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:59.050
Oh, now I've said it...

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.220
Huh?

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.890
Sana-chan, you did it!

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:11.230
You're the first one who's ever
been able to stand up to him!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:13.900
It was just too big a hassle,
or I would have done it sooner.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:17.230
We've been inwardly
hoping for you, Sana-chan.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:20.230
Still, I wonder if
they'll harass Sana-chan now.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.240
Hmph! Let them come!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:26.240
It may be a hassle, but at this point,
what choice do I have?

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:30.160
What else can I do? I'm not
about to lose to that guy.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.620
Fire!!

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:39.920
"The Whole Classroom
is a Monkey Mountain"

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.130
"Boys' Restroom"

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.260
Akito-kun,

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:52.270
thank goodness. I thought you
might start hitting Sana-chan.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.270
Hayama-san, let's let that girl have it!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.610
J- just a minute, Gomi-kun,
that's so barbaric...

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.270
She went on TV and became
all full of herself!

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.860
Her mom's an Aoki Laureate novelist,
so she's rich, and lives in a huge house.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.570
She's full of herself.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.910
Her mom's a weirdo, though.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:09.030
Let's give it to her, Hayama-san!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.630
We'll do it after school.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:18.960
All right, Hayama-san!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.920
--Party! Party!

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.630
Guys, wash your hands!

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.590
Y- you can't...

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.300
--Festival! Fireworks! Woo-hoo!

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.260
--Break out the Mikoshi shrines!

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.300
Wash your hands!

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.850
"We'll do it after school."

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:39.020
Okay then, let's go!

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.570
Sana-chan, be careful, okay?

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:44.990
It's all right. They're
taping "Child's Toy" today,

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.910
so Rei-kun will be coming
to pick me up in his car.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.780
I'll just do this all
the way to the school gate,

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.580
Hayama and the others
can't get close to me!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:56.580
Behold! This is the gateball-stick
handling I learned from Gekidan Komawari!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.580
It also takes calcium and some DHA--

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:00.250
Incredible!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.250
But why gateball?

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.920
I hit myself...

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:06.920
That's the incredible part
about Gekidan Komawari.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.220
Gekidan Komawari is truly awesome.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.600
Sana-chan, this is terrible!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.600
Mami-chan has been
taken away by the boys!

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:17.940
Eh? Why Mami-chan!?

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.270
Remember earlier?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:22.940
Hayama, the devil! The devil's boy!
Go back to the land of devils!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:25.280
Mami-chan said some pretty awful things.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.280
But I said a lot more than she did!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.280
Akito-kun is saying that
you're too much for him, Sana-chan.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.200
Eh? What?

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.870
How should I say, it's like
the cobra and the mongoose...

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.210
Here's the idea.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:41.880
That image just now makes me
out to be the cobra, doesn't it?

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:42.880
It kind of did, yeah.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.550
Never mind that, where's Mami-chan?

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.260
She's in the back yard!

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:52.220
Sana-chan, good luck. You're the
only one who can stop Akito-kun.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.560
What's going on, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.890
Whose side are you on?
You usually stick close to Hayama.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:01.560
I wish he would mend his troublesome ways.
I like Akito-kun, after all.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.230
Gag me.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.900
You keep out of this, you homo!

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:09.900
It's not like that...

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:13.910
It's not love or anything,
I love... it's girls that I...

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.910
I like you, Sana-chan!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.250
He seems to be screaming a
declaration of love for you.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.920
It's too bad. I've got
my pimp Rei-kun, after all.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.920
Eh? Are you serious?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.590
Geez! Never mind, everyone,
what about Mami-chan?

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:27.460
That's right!

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:32.220
Help!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:36.060
Whoa, that's dirty! She's swallowing
the algae from the pond!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.230
You said some interesting
things earlier, huh?

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:45.520
About me being the child of the devil?

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.240
So then, was there anything else?

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:54.240
Hayama-san is asking you!
Go on, tell him.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.910
Mami-chan!

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.910
Out of the way, you dummies!
How could you do this!?

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.580
Mami-chan, are you all right?

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.910
Sana-chan...!

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:01.910
Wow, that's terrible!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:02.920
That's going too far!

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:04.580
How could you do that!?

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.750
Mami-chan...

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.920
What were you guys thinking!?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.920
--Shut up.
--Mami-chan, can you walk?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.970
--Get her to the nurse's office, quick!
--I'll go get my gym clothes.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.270
Hayama...

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:26.610
What? Are you all right?
You're trembling.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:31.610
I'm trembling out of anger.
I've never trembled out of anger before.

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:35.450
Eh? This is your first time, huh?
Congratulations.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:46.000
This is the first time
I've ever hit anyone, too.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.630
This will be the first time
I've ever hit a girl.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:51.550
--Sana-chan!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:52.380
Akito-kun!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.220
Go on and try hitting me, if you can!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:00.560
If you can keep up with this step that
I learned at Gekidan Komawari, that is!

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.520
But if you can't keep up,
you can run away--

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:11.570
Now you've done it!

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:12.900
I can't put up with you any more!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:14.570
I didn't do anything.

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.410
At this point, we're going to have
a private talk. You come with me.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:23.620
Well, now, it's just the two of us.
We're not children here.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.580
Why don't we split our butts
and talk here, hmm?

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.920
It's "spill our guts."
Our butts are already split.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.250
Don't change the subject.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.130
Usually, when it comes
to grades on tests,

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.550
Tsuyoshi-kun comes first,
then you're second smartest, right?

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:39.220
You're not all that stupid, so why is it
that you do nothing but stupid things?

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:41.560
Search me. Maybe because I am stupid.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.560
Answer me seriously!

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.940
What exactly is it that you don't like!?

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:49.230
I don't like anything.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.190
That means you, too.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:54.570
--He's incredibly strong...
--Don't interfere in what I do.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.360
If you butt in one more time,
then starting tomorrow,

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:58.320
you're going to start
having a hard time of it.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:01.580
Sana-chan?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.580
Hayama-san...

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.370
Sana-chan, are you all right?

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.540
Hayama!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.920
I'm not scared by your threats!
Just you watch!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:16.260
Now that I've run out of foursquarence,
I'm going to teach you a lesson in terror!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.550
Nyahh on you!

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:21.800
Don't you mean "run out of forbearance"?
What was that "four-square" business?

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.940
I'm really not taking this anymore!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.190
I am not going to let him
have his way any longer!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:33.480
Fire!!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:39.700
Sana-chan! You say you're going
to make your first appearance

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.530
in a two-hour drama? That's fabulous!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.200
Congratulations! Good luck!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.870
Thanks.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:48.210
But there's something else that
I'm going to need even more luck with.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.540
Though not a whole lot more...

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:53.880
How am I going lo defeat him?
That's the question.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:57.420
Don't interfere in what I do.
If you butt in one more time,

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.550
then starting tomorrow, you're going
to start having a hard time of it.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:01.890
He's incredibly strong...

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:04.560
It's no use! I can't beat him with force!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.560
Ee-yow!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.560
I'm a girl, and I can't beat him by force.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.440
"Child's Toy Fitness Time Special"

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.230
Yow... you could win easy...

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:13.560
What can I do to beat him?

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:17.030
What can you do? Wow, Sana-chan,
you're awl fired up, huh?

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:17.900
You can win, you can win.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.280
There's a goah-geous prize
waiting for the winn-uh

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.910
of today's "Child's Toy
Fitness Time Special"

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:28.910
Huh? Didn't I show the prize?
Hey, how about it?

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.790
"Congratulations on your victory"

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.540
This week's Sana-chan.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:35.590
What should I do to beat him?

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:38.590
♪ What should I do to beat him,
Sri Lanka? ♪

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.720
--I see. So she won before anyone
realized what was happening,

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.720
--♪ What should I do to meat him... ♪

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.600
and got this personality
assessment notebook?

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:48.600
--She was like that the
whole way home in the car.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:48.600
--♪ What shrimp I do to meat him... ♪

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.270
--I'm a little bit concerned.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.270
--♪ have a shrimp fry? ♪

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.730
Right now, there isn't any trouble,

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:54.860
--but we never know
--Favorite drink, coffee...

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:57.610
--when anything is going to happen...
--Favorite expression,
"Bon-san ripped a fart..."

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:01.280
--Once something does happen... Sensei?
--♪What should I do, Sri Lanka?♪

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:04.950
--Oh, here are my results.
--♪What should I do, Sri Lanka?♪

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:08.290
Goodness, it says that I have
the personality of an angel.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.250
--"You are kind to everyone,
--You're kidding, right?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.620
--and loved by everyone."
--Let me see that, please.

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:14.920
Sana, I've got something to tell you.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.550
In order to turn the
fight to your favor,

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.970
the best thing you can do is to
hit your opponent in his weak spot.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.970
Hit his weak spot?

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.970
Oh, I can do that, huh?

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.390
Sensei, that's playing dirty.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:32.230
Sometimes, people have
to play dirty in life!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.060
"Sana-chan Sings"

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.230
♪ Hit him in his weak spot! Play dirty! ♪

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.230
♪ Hit him in his weak spot!
Play dirty! ♪

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:40.230
♪ Hayama's weak spot,
funya-funya, henyara-honyara ♪

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.240
♪ You got it, Sana-chan!
You can beat him, Sana-chan! ♪

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.240
♪ Take advantage of his weakness,
hohoi no hoi ♪

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.570
♪ Playing unfair is
the banner of justice! ♪

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:48.580
Yay!

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.910
That's it!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.510
Hey! Move it, move it!

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:08.350
Hayama-san coming through! Make way!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.180
So, you're here, Hayama...

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:12.850
Go ahead, Hayama-san.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:15.520
Take this, Hayama!
We'll start with a snake!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.650
Just a toy one, though.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:23.860
Sheesh, that's not it, huh? Okay then,
a lizard! Centipede! Water beetle!

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.530
Praying Mantis! Frog!

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:26.530
--Caterpillar! African snail!
--What are you doing!?

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.530
--Sea cucumber! Sea hare!
--Kurata!

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.200
Hayama!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.500
I still have a lot more!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:37.920
Leeks! Onions! Green peppers!
Carrots! Celery!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.500
Jason!

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:42.500
Dracula!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.170
Anatomy model!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:48.510
Even you must be shaking,
ready to say "Sana-chan, I give up!"

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.930
Hayama! You're not scared
at all, huh!? Okay!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:55.520
In that case, I'll show you
what true terror is!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.690
Listen! Listen! Listen to this!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.520
Huh...?

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:03.530
How do you like this!?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.400
Would you cut it out, alrea-- dy...!?

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.870
What's the deal with that?

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:23.090
Y- you don't think that he's
so far removed from humans

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.550
that he doesn't have
a single weak spot...?

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:32.220
Ah, Tsuyoshi-kun... Tsuyoshi-kun,
you'd have to know. That's it!

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:35.470
Tsuyoshi-kun, you know, don't you?

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:36.810
Hayama's weak spot?

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:39.810
Eh? I- I, uh...

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.810
Come on, spit it out.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:44.820
You'll feel better if you spit it out.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:48.150
B- but, that's not something I could...

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.200
Come on, come on,

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.530
you want to help fix your dear
Hayama's troublesome areas, right?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.240
Tell me, tell me.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.700
Are you going to tell me?

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.170
W- what's up with that?

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:11.180
I get it! He was laughing me off!
I get it, I get it. He got me, he got me.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:15.100
So, what are you doing
to me here, Hayama!?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.850
Stop that!

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.520
Take your seats!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.860
Geez, those idiots!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.190
Let's go visit Mami-chan
on our way home.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.190
She must still be in shock, huh?

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.660
What's he doing?

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.660
Why, you...! But until
I find his weak spot,

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:38.660
I just have to put up with it,
put up with it!

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.120
See here!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.500
If you don't like it, why don't
you go call Tanaka-sensei?

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.590
Yeah! Yeah! "Help me, Tanaka-sensei!"

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.050
Tanaka-sensei!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:57.510
Enough! Stop it, you lunkheads!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.140
--Hold her down!
--Right!

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:06.690
Ho ho ho! I can't be caught
by the likes of you!

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.610
You got it.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:12.150
Scissors...?

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:14.200
Let her have it!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.910
What are you doing, you perverts!?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:20.160
How ugly! That's what you get!

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.540
They got me. How could
I let this happen?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.130
But I'm wearing bloomers,
so no problem!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:28.500
Come on by,
anyone who wants to see them!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:31.880
Hayama! Did you order them to do this!?

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.800
No, I didn't.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:37.470
All I said was that if you tried to butt
in again, to have a little fun with you.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:41.100
That's all you said!? Look, you!
Keep this fight between us!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.140
That was dirty!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.690
--Don't use that sassy tone
--Don't use that sassy tone

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:44.480
--with Hayama-san!
--with Hayama-san!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.810
S- stop that, all of you...!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:49.480
--Stop it!
--Akito-kun, make them stop, okay?

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:52.150
Let me go, already!

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:55.570
Waah! The girl I like is being violated,

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:58.370
and I'm just a weak little lamb
who can't do anything about it!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:03.160
Who's being violated!?
Don't say such dire things!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.830
All right, we've got her!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:07.500
Hey, let's go again!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.420
"Watch out, Sana"

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.170
Yow! What are you doing!?

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.300
This is the punishment you get
for going against Hayama-san.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:19.510
Hey! Open up!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.180
What are you doing!? Open up!

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:26.480
Hey, open up! Open up, I tell you!

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:31.530
Eh? That's the end-of-school chime.
That's bad.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:35.780
I'm serious, open up! I've got
a meeting for my drama today!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:40.120
--I can't be late for it!
--Eh? In that case, I'm feeling
like opening up less and less.

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:44.200
Damn...! Calm down and think, Sana.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:50.460
That's it! The rock climbing techniques
you learned in Gekidan Komawari!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.550
Truly, this is a plan where your artistic
skills will get you out of harm's way!{checar}

00:17:56.470 --> 00:18:00.550
This reminds me of the
Channel 108 Annual 2501-Round

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:04.810
First Laughter Entertainer
Rock Climbing Tournament!

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.810
Was there really such a program!?

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:14.480
And so, descending by rope
from here will be as easy as bye-bye.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:18.160
Now let's see, first I have
to tie a rope over there...

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.530
I don't have any rope, do I!?

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.830
Where did that wind come
from all of a sudden?

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.620
Ah, someone's jersey bottoms.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:28.170
There's a name here.
"6th Grade, 1st Class, Obana."

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:31.500
I get it, these are Miho-chan's,
from 1st Class! Lucky!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.170
I'll just borrow these,
wash them and return them later.

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.470
I can't go around looking
like this forever, after all.

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:39.890
Eh? Clouds?

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.680
L- lightning!?

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:48.350
Waah! What's with this crazy weather!?

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.190
A tornado!

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.990
Sana-chan sure is late.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.160
Did she say anything about today
being her turn to clean up?

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:03.490
Open up! Open up, or I'll
curse you, and haunt you!

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.870
That's divine punishment
for going against Hayama-san.

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:08.830
This is too cruel...

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.500
I'm going to go get a teacher.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.830
You want something like what
happened to Mami to happen to you?

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:16.380
She's still home from school over
the shock she received in the pond.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:24.510
Akito-kun, this is going too far!

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.890
Put a stop to this!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:28.980
Akito-kun!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:35.520
It's cold! I'm cold!
I'm going to be late for work!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:39.110
But in life, you can
"never, never give up-upu!"

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:43.450
Hm? There's something
hard stuffed up here.

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:44.620
Burutcha...!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:51.830
I forgot. Oh, I got myself there, huh?

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.710
Rei-kun...

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.260
E- earthquake! E- earthquake!
E- earthquake! I- I'm s- shaking!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:02.090
I- I'm s- shaking, S- Sana-chan!
I- I'm s- shaking!

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.890
Akito-kun, this is too cruel.

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:07.810
Akito-kun!

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.810
What's with you, Tsuyoshi-kun?
You've had some nerve, for a while now.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.480
Don't get too cocky--

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.150
Sana-chan!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.150
Rei-kun!

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:16.480
Rei-kun!

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.480
Eh? Is that the pimp we've heard about?

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.990
He's cool!

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:22.490
Thank goodness!

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.610
Sana-chan, what's going
on with all this?

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:30.830
If you think this is over, then you're
greatly mistaken! But as for today...

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.830
Rei-kun, hurry! To the TV station!

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.750
Eh? It's over?

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:39.760
Yes, just a moment ago.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:42.300
It's my fault for
bringing her here late,

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.430
but still, it has only been ten minutes.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:48.470
Everyone is in high demand, so they're
very busy. That's why we ended so soon.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.810
I didn't make the meeting...

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:54.480
Sana-chan has gone
faceless from the shock.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:57.770
Hmm, I guess you couldn't
help it if you had school.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.440
But it's difficult for us when
you come in once we start shooting.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.150
Yes, I'm sorry about this.

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:03.820
I will be more careful from now on.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:07.120
You may be a child, but you do at
least understand the difference

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:07.780
between work and play, right?

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.450
I'm so sorry.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:10.830
Right, we will be more careful.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.830
Well, if you'll excuse me...

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:19.040
That rotten Hayama...!

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:26.130
I may be tardy getting to school,
but I've never been late getting to work.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:32.810
He'll pay for this. He is going to
pay for this. How could he do this...?

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:37.440
--She's going downhill,
like a middle-aged man.
--He's going to pay for this, he is...!

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.480
--And she's the heroine.
--How could he do this...?

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:42.320
Huh? Sana-chan,
there's someone in front of your house.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.150
It's Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.610
"I have welcome news for you!"

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:50.490
Tsuyoshi-kun, what's the matter?

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:54.870
Sana-chan... l, um... I...

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:56.580
What's wrong?

00:21:56.580 --> 00:22:01.590
Um... I can't take it any more, so I'm
going to tell you Akito-kun's weak spot.

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:03.590
Eh? His weak spot!?{checar}

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:06.930
What? What? What?
"What!?" "What!?" Hm? What?

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:08.930
Um, the truth is...

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:12.600
Zing! Is that right!?

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:16.060
Mama, can I go in your room

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:18.270
with the lame collection of stuff
you bought mail order?

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:21.610
You may, but what do
you mean, lame? How rude.

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:23.940
Well after all, there's nothing
but really weird stuff in here.

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:27.280
Sensei, Maro-chan is scared
of that thing on your head.

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:28.780
Here it is!

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:37.290
With this, I've got Hayama beaten!

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:40.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:45.840
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:50.550
In dire straits,

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:54.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:58.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:03.110
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:03.320 --> 00:23:09.150
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:11.410
...panic!!

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:17.200
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:19.920
he's there.

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:23.170
And our usual classroom...

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:25.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:28.260
...for two.

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:31.720
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:36.470
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:40.060
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:44.770
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:50.360
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:53.030
he's there,

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:56.200
And our usual classroom...

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:58.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:01.290
...for two.

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:07.670
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:12.130
What? What? Fear of heights!?
That's what Hayama's weakness is?

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:14.260
Now that I know that,
I've as good as won!

00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:16.810
I challenge you to a
bungee jump contest, Hayama!

00:24:16.810 --> 00:24:20.520
But then I lose! Oh, isn't there
some other dirty trick I can use?

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:24.400
Oh, right! That's it!
That's it! I'll go with that!

00:24:24.400 --> 00:24:26.560
That's my boyfriend, Rei-kun, for you!

00:24:26.560 --> 00:24:29.480
Next time on Child's Toy, Episode 3
of the Battle of Wind and Storm Saga:

00:24:29.480 --> 00:24:33.450
"Operation Eyeball, Toothball!"

00:24:29.480 --> 00:24:32.070
"Operation Eyeball, Toothball!"

00:24:32.070 --> 00:24:33.410
This is fighting dirty, too!
